><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">control</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="TF1"><p>Nal, nalidixic acid-resistant (100 mg/L); rif, rifampin-resistant (100 mg/L) az, spontaneous sodium azide-resistant (200 mg/L) strain</p><p><sup>*</sup>The number was determined after exposure to HFAC</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>